                  <summary class="list-none w-full py-2.5 rounded-full bg-white hover:bg-[#eae8e0] text-[#101010] text-xs font-bold text-center border border-[#d7d6cf] cursor-pointer shadow-xs transition flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 my-1">
                    <span>Tampilkan 7 Lowongan Lainnya</span>
                    <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-open/expand:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
